Part 4=<p></p>
Only a few hours left to join in on the Cat Parade before we draw our 100 winners of 150 Cat Food!<br>
Comment with a screen shot and the name of your favorite Cat unit to enter before 11:59PM PST on 1/27 (today)!

Here's one last one from us: the Wargods Yukimura, Nobunaga and Keiji about to put the hurt on Those Guys and a Hippoe!<br>
Why not use your 150 Cat Food prize to try for a Vajiras of your own at the Rare Capsule machine?! Enter today! (ↀДↀ)✧
